{"id":"66ec4628784fba110d457f91","slug":"tamara-de-lempicka-raisins-et-oranges","title":"Raisins et oranges","artists":["Tamara de Lempicka"],"date":"ca. 1963","medium":"Oil on Canvas","dimensions":"14 1/2 × 23 1/4 in","image":"rvQhrcI5wdQYB56VAJU3hg","c":["#99683a","#b78e63","#917b56"],"said":[{"k":"writer","q":"Tamara de Lempicka will always continue to defy categorization. Her art and her life destiny do not fit into the usual framework for 20th-century artists. The idea that art could be a profession was foreign to Lempicka. Her life and her painting were too closely intertwined for that.","by":"Alain Blondel","via":"M.S. Rau, on Artsy"},{"k":"note","q":"Painted circa 1963, Raisins et oranges displays Lempicka's masterful use of color and texture to create a remarkable sense of depth in her still life. Ever the adventurer, Lempicka began exploring new painting techniques even at this mature stage of her career.","by":"M.S. Rau, on Artsy"}],"events":[{"k":"made","y":"1963","c":1,"q":"ca. 1963","o":1,"s":[0]},{"k":"made","y":"1963","c":1,"q":"Painted circa 1963","o":1,"s":[1]},{"k":"written","y":"1972","who":"Marc Vaux","t":"Fonds Lempicka","v":"MNAM","q":"Marc Vaux, Fonds Lempicka, MNAM, Paris, 1972","w":"Paris, FR","o":2,"s":[1]},{"k":"owned","y":"1990","who":"Private collection","q":"Private collection, 1990","o":1,"s":[1]},{"k":"owned","who":"M.S. Rau","v":"M.S. Rau","q":"M.S. Rau, New Orleans","ll":[29.9561,-90.0734],"w":"New Orleans, US","p":"new-orleans-us","pr":"city","o":2,"s":[1],"x":[0]},{"k":"written","y":"1999","who":"Alain Blondel","t":"Tamara de Lempicka, Catalogue raisonné 1921-1979","pub":"Tamara de Lempicka, Catalogue raisonné 1921-1979","pg":"no. B456, p. 409","n":"catalogue raisonné","q":"Alain Blondel, Tamara de Lempicka, Catalogue raisonné 1921-1979, Lausanne, 1999, no. B456, p. 409","w":"Lausanne, CH","o":1,"s":[1]},{"k":"listed","y":"2024-09-19","who":"M.S. Rau","n":"listed by the gallery","ll":[29.9576,-90.0649],"w":"New Orleans, US","p":"new-orleans-us","pr":"office","o":2,"s":[0]}],"sources":[{"name":"Artsy","url":"https://www.artsy.net/artwork/tamara-de-lempicka-raisins-et-oranges"},{"name":"M.S. Rau, on Artsy","url":"https://www.artsy.net/artwork/tamara-de-lempicka-raisins-et-oranges"}],"threads":[{"id":"c7eede99","k":"owner","name":"M.S. Rau","at":"New Orleans","y":2018,"n":16}],"asof":"2026-10-01"}